## 5. AI Recommendation Module

The **AI Recommendation Module** is the main intelligent component of PocketSmart AI.

It analyzes the user's financial data and generates recommendations based on spending patterns.

### Processing Steps

```text
User Financial Data
        ↓
Data Collection
        ↓
Data Processing
        ↓
Expense Categorization
        ↓
Spending Pattern Analysis
        ↓
Budget Comparison
        ↓
Recommendation Generation
        ↓
Personalized Suggestions
```

### Example

Suppose the user has:

```text
Monthly Budget       = ₹25,000
Food Expenses        = ₹8,000
Food Budget          = ₹5,000
```

The system identifies that food spending is above the planned limit and can generate a recommendation such as:

> **"Your food expenses are above your planned budget. Consider reducing food-related spending next month."**

Another example:

```text
Monthly Income       = ₹30,000
Monthly Expenses     = ₹20,000
Available Amount     = ₹10,000
```

The system can suggest allocating a portion of the available amount toward a savings goal.

---

## 6. Recommendation Logic

The initial recommendation engine can use rule-based logic.

```text
IF category_expense > category_budget
    THEN generate overspending recommendation

IF total_expense > total_budget
    THEN generate budget warning

IF savings < savings_target
    THEN suggest increasing savings

IF a category shows repeated high spending
    THEN suggest reducing spending in that category
```

As the project develops, this logic can be enhanced using machine-learning techniques and historical spending data.

